title: Maze Cyclops Goal (Gallery, Maze, Cyclops)
story: dungeo
description: Get painting from Gallery, skeleton key from maze, solve cyclops. Restores from wt-02.
---

# Restore state from wt-02 (player at Gallery with torch, portrait, zorkmid)
$restore wt-02

# Get the painting
> take painting

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Troll Room for maze
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get to Troll Room]

> south

> north

> east

# Drop sword to make room for skeleton key (weight limit is 100)
# Sword weighs 10, key weighs 25 - we need to free up space
> drop sword

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate maze to get skeleton key and incense
# Path per 1981 MDL: S → MAZE1 → E → MAZE4 → W → MAZE3 → UP → MAZE5 (get items)
# Items are in MAZE5 (not Dead End per old implementation)
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get skeleton key and incense from maze]

# South to Maze-1
> south

# East to Maze-4
> east

# West to Maze-3
> west

# Up to Maze-5 (where skeleton, coins, key, knife are per 1981 MDL)
> up

# Get the incense first (thief doesn't care about it)
> take incense

# Get the skeleton key
> take key

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate maze to Cyclops Room
# Path per 1981 MDL: MAZE5 SW → MAZE6 E → MAZE7 S → MAZ15 NE → CYCLO
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Get to Cyclops Room]

# Southwest to Maze-6
> southwest

# East to Maze-7
> east

# South to Maze-15
> south

# Northeast to Cyclops Room
> northeast

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Solve cyclops and get to Living Room
# Say "odysseus" or "ulysses" to make cyclops flee
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Solve cyclops and reach Living Room]

# Solve the cyclops puzzle - say the name of his nemesis
> say odysseus

# Go north to Strange Passage, then east to Living Room
> north
> east

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify we made it to Living Room
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Confirm Living Room arrival with treasures]

# Verify we're in Living Room
> look

# Verify we have all treasures from walkthrough so far
> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures and setup for next segment
# ============================================================================

[GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case]

> open trophy case

> put portrait in trophy case

> put painting in trophy case

> put zorkmid bills in trophy case

[END GOAL]

[GOAL: Drop items for next segment - keep only torch]

> drop lantern

> drop incense

> drop key

# Verify we only have torch
> inventory

[END GOAL]

# Save checkpoint for next walkthrough
$save wt-03

# SUCCESS! Gallery, Maze, Cyclops complete - treasures stored, ready for next segment
